      "role": "user",
      "content": "it just feels like there's no \"healing\" from this. like, i've tried the things people say to do, the rest, the talking... but it doesn't change the fact that the exhaustion is just part of me now. it's like there's no version of my life where i'm not just incredibly, fundamentally tired of existing.",
